# Cloudflare Pages response headers
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# Pages already sets Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin and
# X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff on every response; they are repeated here so the
# policy is explicit and survives a future move to another host.
#
# Cache-Control is deliberately NOT overridden. Pages serves each asset straight
# from its own per-deployment cache with an ETag and
# "Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate", so a new deploy is picked up
# immediately. Adding a long max-age here would serve stale CSS/JS to returning
# visitors, and Pages' own docs advise against custom caching on the custom domain.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=()

# NOTE: X-Frame-Options is intentionally omitted. The calculators are a documented,
# supported embed target (?embed=1) meant to be framed by third-party sites, so
# framing must stay open — hence the permissive frame-ancestors above.
